<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on MAN AG.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on MAN AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley, Wertpapiere GmbH has issued six million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on MAN AG, lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE SHARE IS CONTROLLED BY 10 WARRANTS.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	21.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	21.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  434 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE	  PRICE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 435 DEM	 5.46 DEM  12.81 PCT  7.95 X</p>
<p> CALL	 460 DEM	 4.46 DEM  15.52 PCT  9.73 X</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
